     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Olá a todos,</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"></span></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> distmap</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mask</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;x&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shouldn</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;t contain any NAs</span></div></code></div><br><p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"color:black;font-size:12pt\">Esse\r\nerro ocorre durante o uso da função fieldCount() e está relacionado a\r\nconstrução do shapefile. Ao selecionado uma pequena área fora dos limites da\r\nimagem durante o uso da função fieldShape() está área será preenchida com NAs. Assim,\r\ncaso ocorra este erro eu sugiro que corte menos a imagem ao usar a função\r\nfieldCrop() e refaça o shapefile garantindo que está selecionando uma área\r\ndentro dos limites da imagem.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"color:black;font-size:12pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"color:black;font-size:12pt\">Outra </span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><span>solução sera usar </span></font><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(200,38,19)\"><b>na.rm = T</b></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"> disponível na função </font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px\">fieldCount().</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\">Deixe-me\r\nsaber se essa dica ajudou alguém.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:black;border-width:1pt;border-style:none;border-color:windowtext;padding:0in\"> </span></p>\r